<title>JAPAN: Central Leasing to write off loans to Tokai Kogyo.</title>
<headline>Central Leasing to write off loans to Tokai Kogyo.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's Central Leasing Co Ltd said on Friday it would carry out necessary write-offs in the current business year for its loans to failed medium-size general contractor Tokai Kogyo Co Ltd.</p>
<p>The leasing firm said in a statement that the company has loans totalling 15.98 billion yen to Tokai Kogyo, which it said may not be recoverable. But it added that the planned write-off would not affect its earnings forecast for the 1997/98 business year which began April 1.</p>
</text>
